<Behavior #platform-logic-evidence-gate apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #platform-logic-introduction-must-be-evidence-gated (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH49Z>
      系统应当为 `platform-logic` 的引入设置明确证据门槛，而不是因为目标结构中存在该层就提前实现空平台逻辑包。
      </?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH49Z>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "platform-logic-introduction-must-be-evidence-gated" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #no-platform-logic-without-cross-domain-evidence { name = "No platform-logic without cross-domain evidence" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A0>
              必须先具备明确跨领域复用证据或第二领域需求
              </?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A0>
              <Then ?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A1>
              不应为了未来可能复用而提前抽象
              </?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A1>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A2>
              当前只有 AI 领域真实落在平台微内核之上
              </?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A2>
              <When ?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A3>
              团队评估是否引入 `platform-logic`
              </?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A3>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #evidence-gate-must-preserve-current-ownership-boundaries (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A4>
      系统应当确保 platform-logic 的证据门槛不会把 AI 语义错误上移到平台层。
      </?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A4>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "evidence-gate-must-preserve-current-ownership-boundaries" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #candidate-capability-remains-in-current-host-until-evidence-is-sufficient { name = "Candidate capability remains in current host until evidence is sufficient" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A5>
              它应继续留在当前宿主
              </?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A5>
              <Then ?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A6>
              不应为追求结构完整而被提前上收到平台层
              </?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A6>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A7>
              某个能力仍主要服务于 AI domain
              </?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A7>
              <When ?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A8>
              尚未满足 platform-logic 证据门槛
              </?01M05F1P2RNJBGP65T0DKCH4A8>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
